{"id":"1aae99387ae8003d","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent.md","title":"Goodstein 每个正步的严格序数下降","display":"lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent — Goodstein 每个正步的严格序数下降","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent","aliases":["72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent"],"display":"lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent — Goodstein 每个正步的严格序数下降","depends_on":["[[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]]","[[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Lemmas5.3–5.5 and Theorem5.6 proof, print191–192/PDF203–204; ordinary-ordinal consequence","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent — Goodstein 每个正步的严格序数下降"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8761123b6893eaa5\" href=\"?note=8761123b6893eaa5\" title=\"72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump\">72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3a1ff7b2d65e3d2\" href=\"?note=b3a1ff7b2d65e3d2\" title=\"72-lem-hereditary-base-order\">72-lem-hereditary-base-order</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Lemmas5.3–5.5 and Theorem5.6 proof, print191–192/PDF203–204; ordinary-ordinal consequence"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b,a,k\\in\\omega\">\\(b,a,k\\in\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\ge2\">\\(b\\ge2\\)</span>；G 和 ord 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8761123b6893eaa5\" href=\"?note=8761123b6893eaa5\" title=\"72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump\">72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3a1ff7b2d65e3d2\" href=\"?note=b3a1ff7b2d65e3d2\" title=\"72-lem-hereditary-base-order\">72-lem-hereditary-base-order</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0&lt;a\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{ord}_{b+1}(g_b(a))=\\operatorname{ord}_b(a-1)&lt;\\operatorname{ord}_b(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0&lt;a\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{ord}_{b+1}(g_b(a))=\\operatorname{ord}_b(a-1)&lt;\\operatorname{ord}_b(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0&lt;G_{b,a}(k)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{ord}_{b+k+1}(G_{b,a}(k+1))&lt;\\operatorname{ord}_{b+k}(G_{b,a}(k))&lt;\\varepsilon_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0&lt;G_{b,a}(k)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{ord}_{b+k+1}(G_{b,a}(k+1))&lt;\\operatorname{ord}_{b+k}(G_{b,a}(k))&lt;\\varepsilon_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>升底保持序数值；同一底数下由 a−1&lt;a 和严格保序得到下降。再将 b、a 依次代入 b+k、G(k)。这不需要假设自然数序列本身下降；例如原书变体可以连续多步保持相同自然数值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump","status":"resolved","id":"8761123b6893eaa5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-hereditary-base-order","status":"resolved","id":"b3a1ff7b2d65e3d2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump","status":"resolved","id":"8761123b6893eaa5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b,a,k\\in\\omega$ 且 $b\\ge2$；G 和 ord 取 [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]]、[[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-hereditary-base-order","status":"resolved","id":"b3a1ff7b2d65e3d2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$b,a,k\\in\\omega$ 且 $b\\ge2$；G 和 ord 取 [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]]、[[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"b,a,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"0<a\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{ord}_{b+1}(g_b(a))=\\operatorname{ord}_b(a-1)<\\operatorname{ord}_b(a).","display":true},{"tex":"0<G_{b,a}(k)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{ord}_{b+k+1}(G_{b,a}(k+1))<\\operatorname{ord}_{b+k}(G_{b,a}(k))<\\varepsilon_0.","display":true}],"bytes":1546,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-503","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"ea940bfeb1e41d95","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$b,a\\in\\omega$ 且 b≥2，序列使用 [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]]；元理论为 ZFC 的实际序数良基性。"}],"outgoing":["8761123b6893eaa5","b3a1ff7b2d65e3d2"]}